        <div class="callout callout-warning no-break">
            <div class="callout-title">&#128269; Forensic Analysis of Observed PPID Violations</div>
            In legitimate operating system states, <code>svchost.exe</code> is exclusively spawned by the Service Control Manager (<code>services.exe</code>, PID: {{ data.process_tree[2].pid if data.process_tree|length > 2 else 200 }}). The observation of <code>svchost.exe</code> parented by <code>explorer.exe</code> or an interactive user shell is conclusive evidence of process masquerading and PPID spoofing (MITRE T1134.004).
